<div class="page-header">
  <h1 class="page-title">Welcome to FHIR Applicant's Portal</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">A FHIR R5-based platform for compliance submissions to Health Regulatory Authorities</p>
</div>

<div class="feature-grid">

  <a href="/register" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <i class="ph ph-buildings"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-title">Register Organization</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">Search for or create your Organization and Endpoint on the FHIR server before submitting.</div>
    </div>
  </a>

  <a href="/submit-task" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon" style="background:var(--color-accent-light); color:var(--color-accent-dark);">
        <i class="ph ph-paper-plane-tilt"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-title">Submit a Task</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">Create a new regulatory submission Task on a FHIR server, attaching documents and identifiers.</div>
    </div>
  </a>

  <a href="/subscriptions" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon" style="background:var(--color-warning-bg); color:var(--color-warning);">
        <i class="ph ph-bell-ringing"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-title">Subscriptions Dashboard</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">Monitor active FHIR Subscriptions and review incoming notifications from the Health Authority.</div>
    </div>
  </a>

  <a href="/related-tasks" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon" style="background:var(--color-success-bg); color:var(--color-success);">
        <i class="ph ph-graph"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-title">Submitted Tasks</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">Explore the lineage of submitted Tasks alongside linked Authority Tasks in a grouped view.</div>
    </div>
  </a>

  <a href="/authority-tasks" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon" style="background:var(--color-neutral-bg); color:var(--color-neutral);">
        <i class="ph ph-shield-check"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-title">Authority Tasks</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">View and complete Tasks that have been created by the Health Authority in response to your submissions.</div>
    </div>
  </a>

</div>

<div class="alert alert-info mt-6" style="max-width:640px;">
  <i class="ph ph-info"></i>
  <div>Start by <a href="/register"><strong>registering your organization</strong></a>, then <a href="/submit-task">submit a Task</a>. Create a Subscription to monitor updates from the Authority.</div>
</div>
